    "description": "HG-1 (FGC-9 MKII): Laffs Dynamics\n\nSecond Laffs Dynamics handguard design for the FGC-9 weapon platform. \n\nSpecifically for the MKII, simplistic in design.\n\nWide open ended design, the M-Lok slots acting as ventilation of heat. \n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 220C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 7+\nInfill: 38%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 20% \n\nPrint the handguard on it front face. \n\n\n\nNotes:\n\n1) This data pack is just for printing the handguard. To get the base firearm data pack, use the following link: \n(https://odysee.com/@TheGatalog-HybridDesigns:0/FGC-9_MkII_Rev1:f)",
